{"type":"text","timestamp":1790320911673,"sessionID":"ses_f2893c074ffeLsyI0WPVjl2rcC","part":{"id":"prt_0d771252c001NMUzviZRBYPO2L","messageID":"msg_0d770c3db0018PcjMclHl1yigW","sessionID":"ses_f2893c074ffeLsyI0WPVjl2rcC","type":"text","text":"The task is complete. Everything was verified:\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n1. **`scenes/main.tscn`** — Node3D root named `Main` with a `MeshInstance3D` child named `Sphere`. A `SphereMesh` is assigned to `Sphere.mesh`, and a `ShaderMaterial` (sub-resource, assigned onto the SphereMesh) references `res://scripts/triplanar_axis_blend.gdshader` with:\n   - `texture_x` = res://assets/sprites/Rock022_2K-PNG_Color.png\n   - `texture_y` = res://assets/sprites/Grass002_2K-PNG_Color.png\n   - `texture_z` = res://assets/sprites/Rock022_2K-PNG_Color.png\n\n2. **`scripts/triplanar_axis_blend.gdshader`** — Declares `uniform sampler2D texture_x / texture_y / texture_z` and implements normal-based triplanar blending with all the required exact lines:\n   - `vec3 adjusted_normal = pow(abs(normal), vec3(8.0))`\n   - `float use_y_up = float(normal.y > 0.0)`\n   - `vec3 color_y_up = texture(texture_y, uv_y).rgb * weights.y`\n   - `vec3 color_y_down = texture(texture_x, uv_y).rgb * weights.y`\n   - `mix(color_y_down, color_y_up, use_y_up)`\n   - `ALBEDO = (color_x + mix(color_y_down, color_y_up, use_y_up) + color_z) / 3.0`\n\n**Verification done:**\n- Ran the project headlessly in Godot 4.4.1 with a runtime inspection script: confirmed root is Node3D \"Main\", child is MeshInstance3D \"Sphere\", mesh is SphereMesh, material is ShaderMaterial with the correct shader path and all three texture paths.\n- Rendered a frame with a camera verification scene — the sphere rendered correctly with the rock/grass triplanar shader material, then all temporary verification files were removed.\n- Set `run/main_scene=\"res://scenes/main.tscn\"` in `project.godot` so the project runs directly.","time":{"start":1790320911660,"end":1790320911662},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_c5d339d01d264cdf89881b18841a9a86_msg"}}}}
